null},{\"id\":119450,\"title\":\"Dawn of the Planet of the Apes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mSmAc9G25fhOHH45SLEeagR0qi7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SozaNPOYUadcmTPgndDibMyDNC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of scientists in San Francisco struggle to stay alive in the aftermath of a plague that is wiping out humanity, while Caesar tries to maintain dominance over his community of intelligent apes.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49047,\"title\":\"Gravity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kZ2nZw8D681aphje8NJi8EfbL1U.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2n6bKD7qhCPCAEALgsAhWOAQcc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr Ryan Stone, an engineer on her first space mission, and Matt Kowalski, an astronaut on his final expedition, have to survive in space after they are hit by debris while spacewalking.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61791,\"title\":\"Rise of the Planet of the Apes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oqA45qMyyo1TtrnVEBKxqmTPhbN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6cCF0KMUO2QmrVsQFujkQduREXX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A highly intelligent chimpanzee named Caesar has been living a peaceful suburban life ever since he was born. But when he gets taken to a cruel primate facility, Caesar decides to revolt against those who have harmed him.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":39538,\"title\":\"Contagion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2xYil8iO3uaNncmTTMxKbwV3MP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asDdBAvTneGs0k18Blt0oBQbsh8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As an epidemic of a lethal airborne virus - that kills within days - rapidly grows, the worldwide medical community races to find a cure and control the panic that spreads faster than the virus itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333371,\"title\":\"10 Cloverfield Lane\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q8A39vcBDruhvoDTJd6L8a4lnTi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dMERTVrObB7TkRVIFmcndR2sZFH.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic car crash, a young woman wakes up in a survivalist's underground bunker, where he claims to have saved her from an apocalyptic attack that has left the outside world uninhabitable.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":450465,\"title\":\"Glass\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/svIDTNUoajS8dLEo7EosxvyAsgJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rzsMWXQ7GaN60wIpg3yf01iBmXy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a series of escalating encounters, former security guard David Dunn uses his supernatural abilities to track Kevin Wendell Crumb, a disturbed man who has twenty-four personalities. Meanwhile, the shadowy presence of Elijah Price emerges as an orchestrator who holds secrets critical to both men.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10200,\"title\":\"The Day the Earth Stood Still\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vBgFSYmG5tb7GsZ3tHR0WNaWaxA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIxFtd6gcmGGvFxyb1z3mt46CrN.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A representative of an alien race that went through drastic evolution to survive its own climate change, Klaatu comes to Earth to assess whether humanity can prevent the environmental damage they have inflicted on their own planet. When barred from speaking to the United Nations, he decides humankind shall be exterminated so the planet can survive.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":68724,\"title\":\"Elysium\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aRjuJuPXHtVs6YegfeeQWXGRs1E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oo9GyiNKvR4CU1etuYl081UJ1LE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the year 2159, two classes of people exist: the very wealthy who live on a pristine man-made space station called Elysium, and the rest, who live on an overpopulated, ruined Earth. Secretary Rhodes, a hard line government official, will stop at nothing to enforce anti-immigration laws and preserve the luxurious lifestyle of the citizens of Elysium. That doesn’t stop the people of Earth from trying to get in, by any means they can. When unlucky Max is backed into a corner, he agrees to take on a daunting mission that, if successful, will not only save his life, but could bring equality to these polarized worlds.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76726,\"title\":\"Chronicle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdyrdFIt29FUmLIKvedAc2j4rpo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rgNzvSagnlc32TuMEBa529QFIig.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three high school students make an incredible discovery, leading to their developing uncanny powers beyond their understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":97370,\"title\":\"Under the Skin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/55wmcXJIDYITr7JDijJTdvwSaAv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eS5OdKN3kRZXQbWRSSCJ4Gh0z26.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A seductive stranger prowls the streets of Glasgow in search of prey: unsuspecting men